# Souls in Shadow (sandoria 99): the weapon skill point threshold's low side. Accepted by GM with the guide and the
# Scythe of Trials at 299 weapon skill points (one under 300): Novalmauge's 3 with 1; the scythe traded alone: 2 (the
# unfinished weapon, no finish handler: the scythe kept). The main flow takes 300 (1).
lists BostaunieuxOubliette/Novalmauge/onTrigger BostaunieuxOubliette/Novalmauge/onTrade
char zone=BostaunieuxOubliette pos=32.4,-24,19.8 job=DRK lvl=75
quest Sandoria.SoulsInShadow accepted
keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
item ScytheOfTrials wsp=299
login
trigger Novalmauge                        # accepted, no Annals, no map, the scythe held: 3 with 1
finish
trade Novalmauge ScytheOfTrials x1        # 299 weapon skill points (< 300): 2
finish                                    # 2 has no finish handler: the scythe kept
